    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290930/extras/af3a2e2610a80559962e46ee54c7b13e.avif?t=1687372315\" /></span><br>In this single player game the player must trade resources between planets to pay off a gambling debt in a procedurally generated universe, all the while fighting off pirates. With a small inventory of equipment the player must strategically accumulate enough cash to pay their debts and continue a free flowing life. Blast off into a beautiful 1 bit pixel art universe filled with interesting characters to win your freedom.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290930/extras/55f9db1bcc5e86bd5fa2c13379710706.poster.avif?t=1687372315\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290930/extras/55f9db1bcc5e86bd5fa2c13379710706.apng?t=1687372315\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290930/extras/c436131cd69c831dd1cdcb15f0a73da5.avif?t=1687372315\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Procedurally generated universe. <br></li><li>Special weapons and equipment to customize the ship to help travel between planets.<br></li><li>Different environmental areas.<br></li><li>More than 20 characters with unique dialogue.<br></li><li>Interesting battles with space pirates and other ships.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290930/extras/0513f410038dd5ab290baff4245da13f.poster.avif?t=1687372315\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2290930/extras/0513f410038dd5ab290baff4245da13f.apng?t=1687372315\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
